Package: fosos-desktop
Version: 1.3.3
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-pam, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, gir1.2-lightdm-1, lightdm, python3-xlib, openbox, xss-lock, brightnessctl, xsettingsd, arandr, scrot, x11-xkb-utils, x11-xserver-utils, network-manager, network-manager-gnome, wireplumber, fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, adwaita-icon-theme, fosos-theme
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS Desktop session
 The FosOS panel, Start menu, desktop, Files, Terminal, Notepad,
 notifications, lock screen, LightDM greeter and settings shell, running
 on the Openbox window manager. It is the default login session. A
 minimal FosOS Recovery session and text consoles are the fallback when
 the shell fails.
